==Matches==
All times listed are local time.

===Brazil vs Mexico===
Brazilians attacked and Mexicans defended for most of the match. In the first half [[Pelé]] hit the woodwork with a free kick outside the box. Ten minutes after the break he made a cross from the right on [[Mário Zagallo|Zagallo]] who headed the first goal. Then, after 73 minutes, Pele dribbled past four defenders and scored with his left foot from inside the penalty area.<ref>[http://remezcla.com/features/sports/pele-legendary-assault-on-mexico-defense-1962-world-cup/ A Look Back at Pelé's Legendary Takedown of Mexico's Defense at the 1962 FIFA World Cup]</ref><ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXuoPhUEDb4 Brazil vs Mexico on YouTube]</ref>
