===Brazil vs Czechoslovakia===
Brazil had to play part of the game with ten players<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20130118094312/http://www.v-brazil.com/world-cup/history/1962-Chile.php Brazil in the World Cup 1962]</ref> after [[Pelé]] tore a thigh muscle midway through the first half.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20180527012334/https://in.reuters.com/article/us-soccer-world-bra-pele-neymar/brazilians-look-to-pele-and-1962-for-cup-winning-omen-idINKBN0FB0QO20140706 Brazilians look to Pele and 1962 for Cup-winning omen]</ref> Neither side could break the deadlock and the game ended in 0-0 draw.<ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gM7TLZRdo1g Brazil vs Czechoslovakia on YouTube]</ref> The two sides would meet again in the final.

