===Mexico vs Czechoslovakia===
In this game [[Václav Mašek]] scored the second fastest goal in the history of the tournament after only 15 seconds. [[Isidoro Díaz]] equalized after sweeping past two defenders, [[Alfredo del Águila]] made it 2-1 before half time. In the second half Mexicans secured their first World Cup victory with a late penalty converted by [[Héctor Hernández (footballer, born 1935)|Héctor Hernández]]. Mašek’s record would be beaten 40 years later by Turkish footballer [[Hakan Şükür]], after only 10 seconds.<ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hhCZPMBJNXk&t= Mexico vs Czechoslovakia on YouTube]</ref>

